7},{"text":"있으며,","x":1160,"y":1566,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"벗어나는","x":1285,"y":1566,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"정도는","x":1437,"y":1566,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"랜상의","x":1558,"y":1565,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1679,"y":1565,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"어댑터","x":1762,"y":1565,"width":84,"height":40}]},{"text":"들에게 미리 알려져 있지 않다. 수신 어댑터는 단순히 프리앰블의 첫 7바이트에 있","words":[{"text":"들에게","x":611,"y":1629,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"미리","x":726,"y":1630,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"알려져","x":800,"y":1629,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"있지","x":914,"y":1628,"width":60,"height":39},{"text":"않다.","x":991,"y":1628,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"수신","x":1078,"y":1628,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"어댑터는","x":1159,"y":1628,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"단순히","x":1304,"y":1627,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"프리앰블의","x":1420,"y":1626,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"첫","x":1613,"y":1626,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"7바이트에","x":1659,"y":1626,"width":150,"height":37},{"text":"있","x":1825,"y":1628,"width":24,"height":37}]},{"text":"는 비트들에 맞춤으로써 어댑터 A의 클록에 맞출 수 있다. 프리앰블의 8번째 바이","words":[{"text":"는","x":611,"y":1692,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"비트들에","x":659,"y":1690,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"맞춤으로써","x":804,"y":1690,"width":163,"height":39},{"text":"어댑터","x":984,"y":1689,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"A의","x":1095,"y":1689,"width":58,"height":37},{"text":"클록에","x":1168,"y":1689,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"맞출","x":1282,"y":1688,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1362,"y":1688,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1412,"y":1688,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"프리앰블의","x":1502,"y":1687,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"8번째","x":1695,"y":1687,"width":82,"height":37},{"text":"바이","x":1792,"y":1688,"width":55,"height":40}]},{"text":"트의 마지막 두 비트(처음 연속으로 오는 1)는 어댑터 B로 하여금 “중요한 것”이","words":[{"text":"트의","x":612,"y":1751,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"마지막","x":694,"y":1751,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":808,"y":1754,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"비트(처음","x":858,"y":1750,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"연속으로","x":1018,"y":1750,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"오는","x":1164,"y":1752,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"1)는","x":1250,"y":1751,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"어댑터","x":1329,"y":1748,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"B로","x":1446,"y":1753,"width":63,"height":29},{"text":"하여금","x":1525,"y":1748,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"“중요한","x":1648,"y":1748,"width":117,"height":38},{"text":"것”이","x":1782,"y":1749,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"오고 있음을 알려 준다.","words":[{"text":"오고","x":612,"y":1814,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"있음을","x":694,"y":1812,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"알려","x":805,"y":1812,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"준다.","x":881,"y":1812,"width":73,"height":37}]},{"text":"모든 이더넷 기술은 네트워크 계층에게 비연결형 서비스(connectionless service)","words":[{"text":"모든","x":612,"y":1919,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"이더넷","x":695,"y":1917,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"기술은","x":809,"y":1917,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":922,"y":1916,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"계층에게","x":1069,"y":1916,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"비연결형","x":1218,"y":1915,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"서비스(connectionless","x":1368,"y":1916,"width":356,"height":39},{"text":"service)","x":1741,"y":1921,"width":109,"height":35}]},{"text":"를 제공해준다. 즉, 어댑터 A가 데이터그램을 어댑터 B로 전송할 때, 어댑터 A는 먼저","words":[{"text":"를","x":545,"y":1978,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"제공해준다.","x":593,"y":1977,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"즉,","x":781,"y":1980,"width":41,"height":35},{"text":"어댑터","x":838,"y":1977,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"A가","x":946,"y":1977,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"데이터그램을","x":1020,"y":1976,"width":201,"height":39},{"text":"어댑터","x":1235,"y":1977,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"B로","x":1347,"y":1980,"width":62,"height":29},{"text":"전송할","x":1424,"y":1976,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":1542,"y":1977,"width":43,"height":38},{"text":"어댑터","x":1602,"y":1978,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"A는","x":1719,"y":1980,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"먼저","x":1794,"y":1979,"width":53,"height":38}]},{"text":"어댑터 B와 “핸드세이킹”하지 않고 이더넷 프레임에 데이터그램을 캡슐화해서 그 프","words":[{"text":"어댑터","x":547,"y":2038,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"B와","x":662,"y":2038,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"“핸드세이킹”하지","x":737,"y":2038,"width":254,"height":39},{"text":"않고","x":1011,"y":2038,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"이더넷","x":1093,"y":2038,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"프레임에","x":1207,"y":2038,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"데이터그램을","x":1360,"y":2038,"width":212,"height":38},{"text":"캡슐화해서","x":1589,"y":2039,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1778,"y":2045,"width":30,"height":25},{"text":"프","x":1822,"y":2044,"width":29,"height":27}]},{"text":"레임을 랜으로 전송한다. 이와 같은 2계층 비연결형 서비스는 IP의 3계층 데이터그램","words":[{"text":"레임을","x":548,"y":2098,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"랜으로","x":664,"y":2099,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"전송한다.","x":778,"y":2099,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"이와","x":932,"y":2099,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"같은","x":1011,"y":2099,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"2계층","x":1091,"y":2099,"width":87,"height":38},{"text":"비연결형","x":1193,"y":2099,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"서비스는","x":1342,"y":2099,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"IP의","x":1497,"y":2099,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"3계층","x":1584,"y":2100,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"데이터그램","x":1693,"y":2100,"width":155,"height":38}]},{"text":"서비스 및 UDP의 4계층 비연결형 서비스와 유사하다.","words":[{"text":"서비스","x":546,"y":2161,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"및","x":662,"y":2160,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"UDP의","x":705,"y":2161,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"4계층","x":825,"y":2161,"width":87,"height":38},{"text":"비연결형","x":924,"y":2161,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"서비스와","x":1068,"y":2161,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"유사하다.","x":1213,"y":2160,"width":143,"height":39}]},{"text":"이더넷 기술은 네트워크 계층에게 비신뢰적인 서비스를 제공한다. 예를 들어, 어","words":[{"text":"이더넷","x":614,"y":2222,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"기술은","x":731,"y":2222,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":845,"y":2222,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"계층에게","x":991,"y":2222,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"비신뢰적인","x":1140,"y":2222,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"서비스를","x":1323,"y":2222,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1478,"y":2222,"width":151,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":1649,"y":2223,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"들어,","x":1734,"y":2223,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"어","x":1823,"y":2223,"width":24,"height":37}]},{"text":"댑터 B가 어댑터 A로부터 프레임을 수신했을 때 어댑터 B는 CRC를 통해 프레임을","words":[{"text":"댑터","x":547,"y":2282,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"B가","x":630,"y":2282,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"어댑터","x":707,"y":2282,"width":93,"height":39},{"text":"A로부터","x":819,"y":2283,"width":122,"height":39},{"text":"프레임을","x":960,"y":2284,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"수신했을","x":1107,"y":2284,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":1257,"y":2283,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"어댑터","x":1307,"y":2283,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"B는","x":1424,"y":2285,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"CRC를","x":1503,"y":2285,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"통해","x":1638,"y":2284,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":1725,"y":2284,"width":126,"height":38}]},{"text":"검사하지만, 프레임이 CRC 검사를 통과하더라도 응답을 보내지 않으며, 프레임이","words":[{"text":"검사하지만,","x":547,"y":2344,"width":181,"height":39},{"text":"프레임이","x":747,"y":2344,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"CRC","x":897,"y":2350,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"검사를","x":994,"y":2345,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"통과하더라도","x":1110,"y":2345,"width":204,"height":38},{"text":"응답을","x":1331,"y":2344,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"보내지","x":1456,"y":2344,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"않으며,","x":1586,"y":2345,"width":116,"height":39},{"text":"프레임이","x":1722,"y":2345,"width":125,"height":38}]},{"text":"CRC 검사에서 실패했을 때도 부정 확인응답 메시지를 보내지 않는다. 프레임이 CRC","words":[{"text":"CRC","x":544,"y":2410,"width":78,"height":30},{"te