없다.","x":1740,"y":2529,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1823,"y":2528,"width":25,"height":38}]},{"text":"러한 (링크 계층에서의) 비신뢰적인 전송은 이더넷을 단순하고 저렴하게 만들었다. 그","words":[{"text":"러한","x":547,"y":2590,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"(링크","x":627,"y":2591,"width":81,"height":39},{"text":"계층에서의)","x":724,"y":2591,"width":175,"height":40},{"text":"비신뢰적인","x":916,"y":2592,"width":161,"height":39},{"text":"전송은","x":1093,"y":2592,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"이더넷을","x":1205,"y":2592,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"단순하고","x":1351,"y":2590,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"저렴하게","x":1506,"y":2590,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"만들었다.","x":1666,"y":2590,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1821,"y":2594,"width":30,"height":26}]}]}